        "loot": "- `/work/src/session.ts`\n  - `createSession(user: string)`: creates a session object containing `user` and the current timestamp.\n  - `readSession(token: string)`: reads a token and returns `{ user: token }` when truthy; otherwise returns `undefined`.\n\n- `/work/src/middleware.ts`\n  - `requireSession(token: string)`: calls `readSession(token)`, throws `Error('no session')` if no session is found, and returns the session otherwise.\n\n`requireSession` appears only once, in `src/middleware.ts`.",
